#. generated by gettext_extract_pot_p4
#: bin/marionnet.ml:504
msgid ""
"About to remove the run directories that no live session is using. THE "
"UNSAVED WORK THEY HOLD WILL BE LOST -- recover it first if you have not. "
"This is what the cleanup tool sees:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
