"which made Marionnet possible; Renzo Davoli for VDE, the powerful "
"communication infrastructure that we used and modified; the authors of OCaml "
"for their nice language; and of course the whole free software community, of "
"which the GNU and Linux projects remain the foremost contributors.\n"
